3. WORPITZKY BASIS WARNING
identity: x^3 = C(x+2,3)+4*C(x+1,3)+C(x,3)
  x=0: lhs=0 rhs=0 ok=True
  x=1: lhs=1 rhs=1 ok=True
  x=2: lhs=8 rhs=8 ok=True
  x=3: lhs=27 rhs=27 ok=True
  x=4: lhs=64 rhs=64 ok=True
  x=5: lhs=125 rhs=125 ok=True
  x=6: lhs=216 rhs=216 ok=True
  x=7: lhs=343 rhs=343 ok=True
  x=8: lhs=512 rhs=512 ok=True
basis_coefficients=(1,4,1); this is a curve/basis payload, not permission to keep only a scalar.

4. N4 CANARY/FILLER COMPRESSION
fixed_path_fibers={'+': ['a'], '-': ['b'], 'S': ['c', 'bc', 'ac', 'ab', 'abc'], 'T': ['E']}
compression=x=(a OR c), y=(b OR c)
  word=a   class=+ -> xy=(1, 0) xy_class=+
  word=b   class=- -> xy=(0, 1) xy_class=-
  word=ab  class=S -> xy=(1, 1) xy_class=S
  word=abc class=S -> xy=(1, 1) xy_class=S
  word=ac  class=S -> xy=(1, 1) xy_class=S
  word=bc  class=S -> xy=(1, 1) xy_class=S
  word=c   class=S -> xy=(1, 1) xy_class=S
  word=E   class=T -> xy=(0, 0) xy_class=T
readout: the OR map is class-preserving but nonlinear; c is filler when fixed and a canary when erased.

5. DEGREE LEDGER
  symmetric_pair_shadow: degree=1; preserved=a+b and a*b survive unordered pair fibers; sidecar=none, if target predicate is symmetric; status=below Abel-Ruffini wall
  ordered_pair_channel: degree=2; preserved=a^b,b^a orientation channel; sidecar=tail/tip or base/exponent sidecar; status=solvable by ordered sidecar, not by scalar quotient
  K3_edge_flip_kernel: degree=2; preserved=C/T transition law with eigenmode -1/3; sidecar=minority-edge and Worpitzky descent word; status=quadratic-sized preflight
  N4_filler_canary_square: degree=2; preserved=x,y exact four-class transversal after fixing c; sidecar=c-canary status plus S-bulk fiber; status=Klein-square source, no degree growth
  k8_bounded_core_resolvent: degree=4; preserved=HYP-3132/HYP-3142 quartic/biquadratic U4 exit; sidecar=even fold plus odd-coordinate resurrection; status=deepest known live core; still below degree 5
  illegal_raw_scalarization: degree=5; preserved=none: generic quintic-style branch loss; sidecar=route to named debt before theorem use; status=Abel-Ruffini wall / not accepted as proof currency
meta_readout: the current hard core is useful because every accepted carrier stays at degree <= 4; degree 5 is routed to named debt.

